"Tidal locks" = "潮の水門";
"Let walls do the counting" = "壁に歩数を任せる";
"Synchronize unequal lanes against walls, with a finite count and alternating turns." = "壁で長さの違う通路をそろえ、回数と交互の回転を制御しよう。";
"The right banks retreat every two lanes; the left bank stays fixed." = "右岸は二列ごとに後退し、左岸は変わりません。";
"A long walk stops at each bank. Pass the turn as an instruction and reverse it for the next lane." = "長い前進は岸で止まります。回転を命令引数にして、次の列で反転させましょう。";
"Resonant organ" = "共鳴するパイプ";
"Reuse one out-and-back routine in six unequal walled pipes." = "同じ往復手続きを、長さの違う六本の通路に使おう。";
"Each pipe has a cap above and a shared stop below." = "各通路には上の蓋と、下の共通の停止線があります。";
"Overrun in both directions, then move four cells sideways and restore the heading." = "往路も復路も長めに進み、横へ四マス移って向きを戻しましょう。";
"Stepped cloister" = "段々の回廊";
"Track two dimensions while a rectangular route contracts inward." = "二つの寸法を追いながら、長方形の道筋を内側へ縮めよう。";
"Opposite legs differ by two cells; a complete layer consumes four of each dimension." = "向かい合う区間の差は二マス。一周で両寸法が四ずつ減ります。";
"Separate the counted walk from a layer procedure with height and width parameters." = "歩数指定を独立させ、高さと幅を引数に持つ一層の手続きを作りましょう。";
"Counterpoise" = "交互の腕木";
"Grow branches while alternating chirality and preserving a shared spine." = "枝を伸ばし、左右を交互に変えながら、共通の幹を保とう。";
"Five arms grow by two cells; their roots rise four cells each time." = "五本の腕は二マスずつ伸び、根元は四マスずつ上がります。";
"Use count, length and turn parameters. Return to the spine before advancing its root." = "回数、長さ、回転を渡し、幹に戻ってから根元を進めましょう。";
"Gated pinwheel" = "水門の風車";
"Compose a bent arm that returns home facing the next rotated arm." = "曲がった腕を組み合わせ、中心に戻る時に次の腕の方向を向こう。";
"Each arm has a long stem, a sideways gate and a short terminal passage." = "各腕には長い幹、横の水門、短い末端通路があります。";
"Name the counted walk and the complete arm separately; verify its final heading before fourfold reuse." = "歩数指定と腕全体を別々に名付け、四回使う前に最後の向きを確かめましょう。";
"Braided stair" = "編み込む階段";
"Reason about recursive state" = "再帰の状態を考える";
"Swap two instruction arguments while the horizontal reach shrinks." = "横の長さを縮めながら、二つの命令引数を交換しよう。";
"Each rise is three cells; horizontal legs are 10, 8, 6, 4 and 2." = "縦は三マス、横は 10、8、6、4、2 マスです。";
"Pass left and right turns separately, then exchange their parameter positions at the recursive call." = "左右の回転を別々に渡し、再帰呼び出しで引数の位置を交換しましょう。";
"Counterweight stair" = "釣り合う階段";
"Change two numeric parameters in opposite directions, retrace the stair and rotate it four ways." = "二つの数値引数を逆方向に変え、階段を引き返して四方向へ回転させよう。";
"Vertical legs shrink from four to one; horizontal legs grow from one to four. Four stairs share the center." = "縦は四から一へ縮み、横は一から四へ伸びます。四つの階段は中心を共有します。";
"Recurse with X-1 and Y+1, then undo the horizontal and vertical legs after the child returns." = "X-1 と Y+1 で再帰し、子から戻ったら横と縦の区間を逆にたどりましょう。";
"Hinged rosette" = "折り重なる花窓";
"Use work after a recursive call to retrace a nested arm, then rotate it." = "再帰から戻った後の動きで、入れ子の腕を引き返して回転させよう。";
"The hooks shrink by two cells. Every nested call must return to its own starting pose." = "曲がりは二マスずつ縮み、各呼び出しは元の位置と向きに戻ります。";
"Walk outward, turn into a smaller hook, then undo the turn and return before rotating the whole arm." = "外へ進み、小さな曲がりへ回転し、戻ったら回転を戻して中心へ引き返しましょう。";
"Lantern boughs" = "灯りの枝分かれ";
"Visit both recursive children and restore the parent’s position and heading." = "二つの再帰の枝を訪ね、親の位置と向きを復元しよう。";
"Each junction splits left and right; lengths fall 7, 5, 3, 1." = "各節で左右に分かれ、長さは 7、5、3、1 です。";
"A child routine must return home. Between children use a half turn, then retrace the parent stem." = "子は元へ戻る必要があります。二つの子の間で半回転し、最後に親の幹を引き返しましょう。";
"Contrary courts" = "逆向きの中庭";
"Use mutually recursive procedures that exchange dimensions and turn direction." = "相互再帰で寸法と周回方向を交換しよう。";
"Clockwise and counterclockwise rectangles share a corner, but exchange their long and short axes." = "順回りと逆回りの長方形は角を共有し、長短の軸を交換します。";
"Make two layer procedures call each other with the dimensions exchanged and reduced by two." = "二つの層の手続きを互いに呼び、交換して二ずつ減らした寸法を渡しましょう。";
"Lattice atelier" = "格子窓の工房";
"Build patterns within patterns" = "模様の中の模様";
"Nest a fourfold instruction repeater inside finite rows of reusable window tiles." = "四回の命令反復を有限の列に入れ、窓の単位全体を再利用しよう。";
"Sixteen windows form a four-by-four arrangement, linked along each lower edge." = "十六の窓が四行四列に並び、各行の下辺でつながります。";
"Separate walking, repetition, one window and one row. A row must return left before rising." = "歩数、反復、窓、行を分けましょう。行の後は左へ戻ってから上がります。";
"Shifting registers" = "入れ替わる数値";
"Exchange two numeric roles while alternating the connector’s turn." = "二つの数値引数の役割を交換し、接続の回転も交互に変えよう。";
"Widths are 8, 4, 6, 2; gaps are 4, 6, 2, 4. Neither sequence changes monotonically." = "幅は 8、4、6、2、間隔は 4、6、2、4。どちらも単調には変わりません。";
"After a lane of X and a gap of Y, recurse with Y and X-2, plus the opposite turn." = "幅 X と間隔 Y の後、Y、X-2 と逆の回転で再帰しましょう。";
"Recursive lantern" = "再帰の灯宮";
"Assemble four rotated subcurves by swapping two turn parameters at each level." = "各段で二つの回転引数を交換し、四つの回転した曲線をつなごう。";
"The passage has four similar quarters, each made from four smaller quarters." = "通路には似た四区画があり、それぞれも小さな四区画でできています。";
"Use depth and two opposite turns. The first and fourth subcalls exchange the turns; three two-cell links join them." = "深さと逆向きの二回転を渡し、一つ目と四つ目の子で回転を交換。二マスの三本の線で結びましょう。";
"Snowmelt seal" = "雪解けの印";
"Grow an instruction motif recursively, then execute only the selected expansion level." = "命令の模様を再帰で育て、選んだ段階の展開だけを実行しよう。";
"Each straight segment becomes five segments with right, left, left, right turns. Four trap caps forbid overrunning the folds." = "各直線は五区間になり、右、左、左、右と回転します。四つの罠の端では進み過ぎに注意。";
"Carry the expanded instruction as a parameter. A second numeric guard selects the deepest layer before fourfold rotation." = "展開した命令を引数にし、二つ目の数値条件で最深段を選び、四方向に回転させましょう。";
"Lantern atlas" = "灯窓の地図";
"Place four recursive copies at offsets, using depth and spacing as independent parameters." = "深さと間隔を別々に制御し、四つの再帰模様をずらして配置しよう。";
"Four large corner groups contain four smaller groups; each connector must be retraced." = "四つの大きな角の組に、四つの小さな組があり、接続線は引き返します。";
"Factor a corner trip that returns rotated by a quarter turn; repeat it four times and reduce spacing by three in each child." = "角へ行って戻り、四分の一回転する手続きを四回使い、子の間隔を三減らしましょう。";
"Dragon gallery" = "ドラゴンの回廊";
"Compose recursive systems" = "再帰を組み合わせる";
"Use two mutually recursive turns to generate a folding curve rather than a repeated tile." = "単位の反復ではなく、二種類の相互再帰で折り畳み曲線を作ろう。";
"The two halves have related folds, but their turns are ordered differently." = "前後の折り方は関連しますが、回転の順序が違います。";
"One procedure expands A, right, B, walk, right; its partner expands left, walk, A, left, B." = "一方は A、右、B、前進、右、もう一方は左、前進、A、左、B と展開します。";
"Dragon compass" = "竜紋の羅針盤";
"Construct inverse recursive procedures so a folded curve returns before its next rotation." = "再帰の逆手続きを作り、折り畳み曲線を戻ってから回転させよう。";
"Four folded arms share a center. Finishing a curve does not automatically restore its starting pose." = "四つの折れた腕は中心を共有しますが、曲線の終わりでは元の位置と向きに戻りません。";
"Reverse the order of each recursive body and exchange left with right; surround the inverse trip with half turns." = "各再帰の本体を逆順にし、左右を交換。逆の道筋の前後で半回転しましょう。";
"Chiral canopy" = "回転する樹冠";
"Combine a branching return invariant with chirality passed through four recursive levels." = "枝分かれから戻る条件と、四段に渡す回転方向を組み合わせよう。";
"The same branch is reflected differently in its two children, then reused in four directions." = "同じ枝でも二つの子では反転が違い、さらに四方向へ使います。";
"Pass depth, stem length and a turn. Reverse the turn for one child; return to the parent pose after both children." = "深さ、幹の長さ、回転を渡し、一方の子で回転を反転。両方の後で親の状態へ戻りましょう。";
"Vaulted mosaic" = "丸天井のモザイク";
"Nest window, row, shrinking tier and rotation routines, each with its own return invariant." = "窓、行、縮む段、回転を入れ子にし、それぞれ元に戻る条件を保とう。";
"Each sector has three tiers: three large windows, two medium windows, one small window." = "各区画は三段で、大窓三つ、中窓二つ、小窓一つです。";
"Let the row recurse sideways and unwind back; let the tier recurse upward and unwind down, then rotate the whole sector." = "行は横へ再帰して戻り、段は上へ再帰して下へ戻り、最後に区画全体を回転させましょう。";
"Astral cathedral" = "星空の聖堂";
"Compose a window generator with a chiral branching tree and a higher-order rotation routine." = "窓枠、回転する分岐木、高階の回転手続きを組み合わせよう。";
"Every node is both a square courtyard and a branch junction; depth, size and chirality change independently." = "各節は四角い庭でも分岐点でもあり、深さ、寸法、回転方向が別々に変わります。";
"Prove the courtyard and each subtree return to the same pose. Build one sector from those contracts, then pass it to a fourfold repeater." = "庭と各部分木が元の状態へ戻ることを確認し、一つの区画を組み立てて四回反復へ渡しましょう。";
